      "title": "Smarter, Better, Faster, Longer: A Modern Bidirectional Encoder for ...",
      "url": "https://aclanthology.org/2025.acl-long.127/",
      "snippet": "Abstract Encoder-only transformer models such as BERT offer a great performance-size tradeoff for retrieval and classification tasks with respect to larger decoder-only models. Despite being the workhorse of numerous production pipelines, there have been limited Pareto improvements to BERT since its release. In this paper, we introduce ModernBERT, bringing modern model optimizations to encoder ..."
